 if(choice)return `<section class="identity-death identity-choice" aria-labelledby="identity-choice-title"><header><h3 id="identity-choice-title">留下哪一份遗骸？</h3><p>本轮16关仅可保留1张死亡身份。选择后重试自动携带；通关全部16关后，保留的身份才会永久解锁并可自由组卡。</p></header>${identityGrowthHTML()}<div class="identity-options">${[['old','此前暂存',choice.old,'identity-keep','保留旧身份'],['new','本次死亡',choice.new,'identity-replace','替换为新身份']].map(([key,label,c,action,button])=>`<article class="identity-option" data-identity-option="${key}"><h4>${label}</h4>${cardHTML(c)}<p class="identity-origin">死于：${esc(c.by||'余火耗尽')}</p><button class="${key==='old'?'pri':''}" data-a="${action}">${button}</button></article>`).join('')}</div><p class="identity-rule">请选择一张后返回篝火。另一张不会加入永久收藏。</p></section>`;
